This folder holds streamline / tractography files derived from:

  HCP-1065 population-averaged tractography atlas (Yeh, 2022)
  https://github.com/frankyeh/data-atlas/releases/tag/hcp1065

derived from Human Connectome Project young-adult diffusion MRI data.

